// TEST: Store-Inherited Chunking Needs A Store Axis (rejects)
// `Chunked<I, store>` reads the chunk edge the provider recorded for a
// STORE dimension at its load site; a plain `Idx<n>` alias has no store to
// inherit from. (The inheritance itself is exercised in the zarr lane,
// `blade test zarr`, section 10c: a generated store chunked at four.)
// ERROR: BL3999
// ERROR-CONTAINS: inherits the chunk grid of a STORE axis
type I = Idx<10>
type CI = Chunked<I, store>
